0,Alto Pativilca–Alto Marañón–Alto Huallaga Quechua - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha_Quechua,(Redirected from Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha Quechua). Quechua dialect cluster of Peru. Alto Pativilca–Alto Marañón–Alto Huallaga Quechua. kichwa.,"Quechua, Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha",Quechuan
1,"Quechua, Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/qvm/,"Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha Quechua is a stable indigenous language of Peru. It belongs to the Quechuan language family and is part of the Quechua macrolanguage. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community.","Quechua, Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha",Quechuan
2,Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha Quechua - qvm... - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/qvm/,"Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha Quechua (qvm) is part of the Quechuan family and Quechuan, Central Quechua, Ap-am-ah, Alto Marañón class. Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha Quechua speaking People Groups across the world: Fast Facts: Types.","Quechua, Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha",Quechuan
3,"Quechua, Margos language. Evangelism tools, church planting...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/qvm,"Download Quechua Margos - God Made Us All.mp3.Short audio Bible stories and evangelistic messages that explain salvation and give basic Christian teaching. Each program is a customised and culturally relevant selection of scripts, and may include songs and music.","Quechua, Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha",Quechuan
