6,Endangered Languages Project - Alto Marañón Quechua,https://www.endangeredlanguages.com/lang/8114,"Quechuan, Quechua I. ORTHOGRAPHY. Latin (Spanish based).Alto Marañón Quechua [qvm] is sometimes listed as an alternate name of Alto Huallaga [qub], as both are Ap-am-ah Central Quechuan languages.","Quechua, Margos-Yarowilca-Lauricocha",Quechuan
